# Overlay patch -- a deliberate artifact, not an unfinished diff.
#
# This repository does not vendor its upstream bases. `setup.sh --code`
# clones YoungZ365/SOD at pinned commit 110c4b8 and applies this patch over
# it (18 hunks over 8 files, +98/-18), then installs the DTDD recipe as new
# files under recipe/dtdd/. `git apply --check` passes against a clean
# checkout of that commit.
#
# None of these hunks is the method: one is an evaluation-correctness fix
# (LiveCodeBench graded each problem on the same test case it showed in the
# prompt), one exposes OPD step-weight metrics, and the rest are robustness
# and transformers-compatibility fixes. PATCH_NOTES.md in this directory
# explains each hunk and why it exists.
#
# Text before the first "diff --git" line is ignored by git apply.

